\title{stanSPsurv: Bayesian Split-Population Survival Models with Stan}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

Fits Bayesian split-population (cure) survival models with Weibull or log-logistic event-time distributions using Stan via 'cmdstanr'. Provides pooled, exchangeable group-frailty, and scaled proper conditional autoregressive (CAR) spatial specifications through a common formula interface. Includes methods for coefficient extraction, prediction, frailty visualization, survival curves, and choropleth mapping of spatial effects.
